  "prefLabel": "Rev 2301.01 Bad debts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2301.01 “Bad debts” means amounts that are uncollectible from accounts and notes receivable that were created or acquired in providing inpatient and outpatient services and which neither the patient nor the guarantor is willing to pay.\n\nSource. #9913, eff 4-21-11; ss by #12823, eff 7-4-19",
